@ContentDB_HostAddress = http://localhost:5175

### 健康检查
GET {{ContentDB_HostAddress}}/healthz
Accept: application/json

### 包列表(懒缓存 + URL 改写)
GET {{ContentDB_HostAddress}}/api/packages/
Accept: application/json

### 更新检查(客户端轮询)
GET {{ContentDB_HostAddress}}/api/updates/?protocol_version=47
Accept: application/json

### 客户端商店详情
GET {{ContentDB_HostAddress}}/api/packages/Wuzzy/mineclone2/for-client/?formspec_version=7&protocol_version=47
Accept: application/json

### 下载(首次同步拉取入 S3,然后 302 到 CDN)
GET {{ContentDB_HostAddress}}/packages/Wuzzy/mineclone2/releases/1/download/
